omen’s team had won seven FIVB World Grand Prix’s since 1993 and was ranked number one coming in to Beijing. But the Brazilians had never won a gold medal in women’s volleyball. At the 2006 World Championships, they had been runners-up behind Russia. The semi-finals saw Brazil playing the hometown Chinese, the defending gold medalists, and the United States playing the formerly dominant Cuban team. But neither team was a match for Brazil and the United States as both won easily in three sets. The United States had not won a major international event in women’s indoor volleyball, but in Beijing, US teams won the men’s indoor volleyball gold, and both beach volleyball gold medals. But Brazil was too strong, and the US could not sweep the volleyball gold medals, losing in four sets, 25-15, 18-25, 25-13, 25-21."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button137875", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button137875').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Matches Played"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sets"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Set Ratio"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points Ratio"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {:class "accordion-toggle", :data-toggle "collapse", :data-target ".team-members-1300511"} [:div {:class "glyphicon glyphicon-plus"}]] [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} "Brazil"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.ama